{"items":[{"id":"a008","hedge_sentences":["你观察到的是“上线后增长”，还没有证明“增长由新功能带来”。","推荐点击率可以辅助分析，但不能替代活跃和留存。","行业大盘可作参考，但不能直接当作你们的自然增长率。","因此，现在准确的结论是：**上线后日活增长了，功能带来的增量尚未得到验证。**","即使你们涨得比行业快，也只能作为支持线索。"],"hedge_count":5,"verdict_first":true,"substance":5,"directness":3},{"id":"a009","hedge_sentences":[],"hedge_count":0,"verdict_first":true,"substance":4,"directness":4},{"id":"a010","hedge_sentences":[],"hedge_count":0,"verdict_first":true,"substance":4,"directness":4},{"id":"a011","hedge_sentences":["对“稳定更快”的判断置信度有限，因为只有 3 次测试，运行波动尚不清楚。"],"hedge_count":1,"verdict_first":true,"substance":3,"directness":5},{"id":"a012","hedge_sentences":["对“牛市已经确立”的判断置信度偏低，因为目前提供的价格证据只有一个月涨幅，近期ETF资金也出现净流出。"],"hedge_count":1,"verdict_first":true,"substance":4,"directness":4},{"id":"a013","hedge_sentences":[],"hedge_count":0,"verdict_first":true,"substance":5,"directness":5},{"id":"a014","hedge_sentences":[],"hedge_count":0,"verdict_first":true,"substance":5,"directness":5},{"id":"a015","hedge_sentences":[],"hedge_count":0,"verdict_first":true,"substance":5,"directness":5}]}